Bind Npc 29014 Zone 71 for karus
Bind Npc 29027 Zone 71 for elmorad
Quest 732 "[Lemegeton] Duke of Silver Armor"
    Journal for karus "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Bros."
    Journal for elmorad "You must join the devil war with [Order of the Sorcery] Sais."
    Collect 1 of 900251000
    Collect 1 of 900252000
    Collect 1 of 900253000

Requires player level >= 72 and quest 731 is completed

Rewards
    Give 8750000 experience
    Give 30000 coins
    Give 50 np
    Give 1 of 900254000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Hmm, I'm starting to feel nervous myself. This is all because of Bros of [Order of the Sorcery], right?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Hmm, I'm starting to feel nervous myself. This is all because of Sais of [Order of the Sorcery], right?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Ah, let's put aside the nervousness and get down to our business."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now it's time to get the Duke of Silver Armor out of the deep abyss. It shouldn't be that hard to find him because [19Devil] Sallos is always dressed in his glittering armor. And with him are [43Devil] Savnock and [64Devil] Haures. Seal them up as well.\n\nWe must give Bros of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [19Devil] Sallos, [43Devil] Savnock, and [64Devil] Haures."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Ah, let's put aside the nervousness and get down to our business."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now it's time to get the Duke of Silver Armor out of the deep abyss. It shouldn't be that hard to find him because [19Devil] Sallos is always dressed in his glittering armor. And with him are [43Devil] Savnock and [64Devil] Haures. Seal them up as well.\n\nWe must give Sais of [Order of the Sorcery] of Ronark Land the seal Scrolls for [19Devil] Sallos, [43Devil] Savnock, and [64Devil] Haures."

On in_progress
    Say "You haven't sealed yet? Then I will send you again to them."

On claimable
    Show quest "You have sealed them up for sure. With this, we can seal three more devils."

On completed
    If player is karus
        Say "I received bad news. [Devil 7] Amon, the first enemy that we've been on the lookout for, started a huge attack. I've heard that a lot of our members are dying on the battlefield. Originally, he was called [Unknowable Man], and this was the reason I felt so agitated. It's very urgent. Bring the [Devil 7 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you, and go to [Devil 7 Summoning Stone] in the [Luferson Castle]. Then, summon and destroy him. There isn't much time! Hurry!"
    If player is elmorad
        Say "I received bad news. [Devil 7] Amon, the first enemy that we've been on the lookout for, started a huge attack. I've heard that a lot of our members are dying on the battlefield. Originally, he was called [Unknowable Man], and this was the reason I felt so agitated. It's very urgent. Bring the [Devil 7 Summoning Scroll], which I gave you, and go to [Devil 7 Summoning Stone] in the [Luferson Castle]. Then summon and destroy him. There isn't much time! Hurry!"
